  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5642,
      "text": "Did We not create you from a worthless fluid,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5643,
      "text": "then We placed it in a secure repository",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5644,
      "text": "for a determined period[4]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5645,
      "text": "For We determined it; How excellently We determine!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5646,
      "text": "Woe on that Day to the deniers!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5647,
      "text": "Have We not made the earth a receptacle[5]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5648,
      "text": "for the living and the dead,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5649,
      "text": "and placed therein firm towering mountains, and given you fresh water to drink?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5650,
      "text": "Woe on that Day to the deniers!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5651,
      "text": "[They will be told,] “Proceed to that [Fire] which you used to deny!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5652,
      "text": "Proceed to the shadow [of smoke] ascending in three columns,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5653,
      "text": "that provides neither shade nor protection from the flames.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5654,
      "text": "Indeed, it [i.e., Hell] throws up sparks as big as castles,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5655,
      "text": "as if they were tawny camels[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
