      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 516,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5663,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be amid shades and springs",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 517,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5664,
      "text": "and will have whatever fruit they desire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 517,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5665,
      "text": "[They will be told,] “Eat and drink joyfully, as a reward for what you used to do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
        "numberOfAyahs": 50,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 581,
      "ruku": 517,
      "hizbQuarter": 232,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5666,
      "text": "This is how We reward those who do good.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 77,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُرۡسَلَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mursalaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Emissaries",
